# Normalise ALL text to LF in the repo and on checkout, so the generated page
# and fixtures match Node's LF output on the Linux runner (the determinism gate
# does `git diff --exit-code`). Shell scripts MUST be LF for bash. pcaps are
# binary and must never be line-ending-converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.pcap binary
*.webmanifest text eol=lf
